@char1 A survivor in the post-apocalyptic wasteland, wearing a worn, hard-wearing tactical jacket, cargo pants and combat boots, with a full-face wind mask and tactical goggles, holding a survival knife in his right hand.
@char2 A bright yellow post-apocalyptic modified muscle car with a lifted chassis, fitted with giant off-road tires and a roof light rack. A striking twin-intake supercharger is mounted on the hood, and a heavy metal bull bar is installed at the front. The body is covered in dust, scratches and battle scars.
@char3 Vast, desolate arid desert wasteland with dust covering the ground and swirling dust in the air. The sky is a murky yellow-grey post-apocalyptic hue with a hazy, indistinct horizon, presenting a bleak landscape. It features cinematic post-apocalyptic atmosphere, warm dusty tones and rough film grain texture. The camera follows the foreground subject.


Camera Movement: The sequence opens with a low-angle side tracking shot, moving in tandem with @char1’s footsteps. As @char1 advances, the camera executes a smooth ascending orbit shot (crane shot), circling from the side to a rear three-quarter perspective of the character. The orbiting motion is combined with dynamic dolly zoom effect (the camera moves backward while zooming in), keeping @char1 framed within the shot, while the background explosion visually expands drastically in scale and impact. Slight handheld camera shake is maintained throughout the sequence to amplify the raw explosive force of the blast. All camera movements are continuous and fluid, transitioning seamlessly from a close side profile of the character to a vast, chaotic scene.
